=head1 DESCRIPTION

An A2P Brand Registration represents a brand registered with The Campaign
Registry (TCR) for 10DLC messaging. This endpoint creates a new brand
registration and initializes a Persona embeddable compliance session that the
ISV's end user completes to submit brand information.

This file holds C<A2PBrandRegistrationList> and
C<A2PBrandRegistrationInstance>. Methods that make a request throw
L<Twilio::Exceptions::RestException> on an error response.

